Modifications in this repository (Apache License 2.0, Section 4(b))

This repository ("dsh-purge-custom", https://github.com/zhaofeng104/dsh-purge-custom)
is a modified build derived from:
  - upstream origin : YuJunZhiXue/dsh-purge (author: 小杨)
  - baseline        : HunYiSage/dsh-purge version 1.1.90
  - mirror used     : ZXEB/dsh-purge

Version of this build: 1.2.0
Customized by        : zhaofeng (https://github.com/zhaofeng104)
Custom build home    : https://github.com/zhaofeng104/dsh-purge-custom

Summary of changes (details in README.md section 2 and CHANGELOG-1.2.md):
  1. lib/net-scope.js replaced with the 1.1.71 implementation, then modified:
     installRegionGate() is a no-op and taskTargetHit() always returns null.
  2. package.json version 1.1.90 -> 1.2.0 with a rewritten description.
  3. Repository/homepage/bugs/install URLs and the self-update source now
     point to this repository instead of the upstream mirror.
  4. Added: package.json exports entry "./presets-plugin", the "skills" entry
     in the files whitelist, and the bundled presets/unrestricted preset.
  5. presets/redteam/agent.cordis.yml: removed the obsolete list-agents mount.
  6. Removed from the published tree: upstream private archives, build caches
     and local-only artifacts.

The original 1.1.71 implementation of installRegionGate() is retained verbatim
at lib/net-scope.js.1.1.71-orig so the upstream region/target gate can be
restored.

Upstream README files are preserved unchanged under docs/upstream/.
